### portfolio health
GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/health
X-Request-Id: manual-portfolio-health

### portfolio liveness
GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/health/liveness

### portfolio prometheus
GET http://localhost:8084/actuator/prometheus

### ---- P12b /v1/calc/* (ADR-0018): stateless, POST only, paise and bps. Needs a user token:
### sign in via identity.http (POST /v1/auth/login) and paste the accessToken below.
@calcToken = PASTE_AN_ACCESS_TOKEN

### calc: EMI quote - Rs 1,00,000 over 12 months at 15 % -> 902583 paise a month
POST http://localhost:8084/v1/calc/emi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{calcToken}}
X-Request-Id: manual-calc-emi

{"principalPaise": 10000000, "annualRateBps": 1500, "tenureMonths": 12, "processingFeePaise": 19900,
 "firstDueDate": "2026-11-05"}

### calc: one cycle's interest - Rs 5,000 bought, Rs 2,000 paid on the 10th -> 12427 paise
POST http://localhost:8084/v1/calc/ledger
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{calcToken}}
X-Request-Id: manual-calc-ledger

{"terms": {"aprBps": 4200, "cashAdvanceAprBps": 4200,
           "paymentAllocationOrder": ["retail_purchases", "cash_advances"]},
 "cycleStart": "2026-01-01", "cycleEnd": "2026-01-30",
 "transactions": [{"date": "2026-01-01", "type": "PURCHASE", "amountPaise": 500000,
                   "bucket": "retail_purchases", "referenceNumber": "TXN-1"},
                  {"date": "2026-01-10", "type": "PAYMENT", "amountPaise": 200000}]}

### calc: minimum due, finance-charge-conditional -> 43700 paise
POST http://localhost:8084/v1/calc/minimum-due
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{calcToken}}
X-Request-Id: manual-calc-minimum-due

{"terms": {"formulaType": "FINANCE_CHARGE_CONDITIONAL", "flatFloorPaise": 20000,
           "retailCashPercentBps": 500, "roundUpToNearestPaise": 1000},
 "retailCashOutstandingPaise": 800000, "financeChargesPaise": 15000, "gstAmountPaise": 2700,
 "totalAmountDuePaise": 817700}

### calc: minimum only - the 141-cycle case (Rs 30,820.88 extra on Rs 10,000 at 42 %)
POST http://localhost:8084/v1/calc/scenarios/minimum-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{calcToken}}
X-Request-Id: manual-calc-minimum-payment

{"terms": {"aprBps": 4200, "cashAdvanceAprBps": 4200,
           "paymentAllocationOrder": ["retail_purchases", "finance_charges", "fees"]},
 "minimumDueTerms": {"formulaType": "HIGHER_OF", "percentBps": 500, "flatAmountPaise": 20000},
 "startingPrincipalPaise": 1000000, "cycleLengthDays": 30}

### calc: exit paths - Rs 2,141.01 a cycle clears Rs 6,000 in 3 cycles
POST http://localhost:8084/v1/calc/exit-paths
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{calcToken}}
X-Request-Id: manual-calc-exit-paths

{"terms": {"aprBps": 3600, "cashAdvanceAprBps": 3600,
           "paymentAllocationOrder": ["finance_charges", "retail_purchases"]},
 "minimumDueTerms": {"formulaType": "HIGHER_OF", "percentBps": 500, "flatAmountPaise": 20000},
 "currentBalancePaise": 600000, "cycleLengthDays": 30, "targetCycles": [3, 6, 12]}

### calc: avalanche vs snowball across two cards
POST http://localhost:8084/v1/calc/repayment-path
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{calcToken}}
X-Request-Id: manual-calc-repayment-path

{"monthlyBudgetPaise": 300000,
 "cards": [{"id": "a", "name": "A", "balancePaise": 1000000, "aprBps": 4200, "minimumDuePaise": 50000},
           {"id": "b", "name": "B", "balancePaise": 500000, "aprBps": 1800, "minimumDuePaise": 25000}]}
